{"version":1,"key":"card:635","content":{"id":635,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为什么节食不行：我们的身体通过代谢率来控制输出，当节食时大脑会以为进入了饥荒状态，会降低代谢率，导致疲劳，烦躁，当恢复饮食时会迅速反弹。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"影响因素："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"果糖，不是指水果中和纤维混在一起的糖，而是指人工加工的果糖，果糖不像葡萄糖可以被细胞利用，果糖的代谢路径只有被肝脏转化为脂肪"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"瘦素抵抗，瘦素是脂肪细胞分泌的激素，告诉大脑已经够了，不必再吃了，但是超重的人会分泌大量瘦素，导致大脑无法处理这么多瘦素，导致瘦素抵抗，机制失灵，反而会让我们产生饥饿感，疯狂的吃东西"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"胰岛素风暴，当我们吃下大量碳水时（白米饭、白面等），血糖水平迅速升高，会刺激我们的胰腺分泌胰岛素，胰岛素会促使这个葡萄糖进入细胞被分解利用，而无法被分解的就会被转化为脂肪存储，由于产生的大量胰岛素会导致血糖迅速下降，会重新产生饥饿感，而且会伴随着大量葡萄糖转化为脂肪"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"压力，在远古时期，外部压力会导致我们生成皮质醇激素，这种激素会促使我们战斗和逃跑，但是在现代，我们压力来自于KPI、领导、房贷等，持续的皮质醇水平会让你倾向于高热量食物，并且更倾向于把脂肪存储在腹部"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"睡眠，睡眠不足会导致体内饥饿素飙升，瘦素水平下降"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解决办法：发送正确信号给大脑，我们现在的环境很安全，不需要这么多脂肪了。"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"饮食习惯，减少加工食物（糖，精致碳水）的摄入"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"甜甜圈 → 牛油果沙拉"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"果汁 → 完整的水果（包含纤维，可减缓葡萄糖水平飙升）"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"轻断食，适度拉长进食间隔，十几个小时不进食，胰岛素水平下降，从燃糖变为燃脂"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"改变生活环境，听音乐，和朋友聊天，降低压力"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"保证充足睡眠"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"运动"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"目的不是为了燃烧卡路里，消耗掉的一杯奶茶就补回来了，而且还会刺激你的饥饿感"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"而是发送强大的信号，告诉我们的身体需要更强大的肌肉，特别是力量训练，增加肌肉量，提高基础代谢率，减少胰岛素抵抗"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考资料："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qKstzJE8d","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"外科医生揭秘：重设你的体重开关，让身体主动为你减肥！"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}],"tags":["健康"],"createTime":1761609578632,"updateTime":1761991676600,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1761991676600}}